sequenceDiagram
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
        Note over Prom,K8s: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling (Legacy WVA)
        participant SatEng as Saturation Engine<br/>(WVA Controller)
        SatEng->>Prom: Query vLLM metrics<br/>HTTPS / Bearer token or mTLS
        Note right of SatEng: KV-cache utilization<br/>Queue depth<br/>Request throughput
        Prom-->>SatEng: Metric values<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+
        SatEng->>SatEng: Run analyzer pipeline<br/>(V1 percentage / V2 token-capacity)
        SatEng->>K8s: PATCH Deployment/LWS scale<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        Note right of SatEng: DirectActuator patches<br/>desired replicas
    end

    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
        Note over Prom,K8s: Flow 2: KEDA-Based Autoscaling (Active)
        participant KEDA as KEDA Operator
        participant HPA as HorizontalPodAutoscaler
        KEDA->>Prom: Query trigger metrics<br/>HTTPS / configured auth
        Note right of KEDA: vllm:num_requests_waiting<br/>vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc
        Prom-->>KEDA: Metric values<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+
        KEDA->>K8s: Update HPA target<br/>HTTPS / SA token
        K8s-->>HPA: HPA scaling decision
        HPA->>K8s: PATCH Deployment scale<br/>HTTPS / kube-controller-manager SA
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over Prom,K8s: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
        Prom->>SatEng: Scrape /metrics endpoint<br/>HTTPS/8443 / Bearer token
        Note right of Prom: ServiceMonitor-configured<br/>TLS (self-signed or service-ca)
        SatEng-->>Prom: Controller metrics
    end
